      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "FioraPassive",
        "name": "决斗之舞",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "菲奥娜已在这名英雄身上发现了一处<keywordMajor>破绽</keywordMajor>。如果她命中了这处<keywordMajor>破绽</keywordMajor>，她就会<healing>回复生命值</healing>并获得<speed>移动速度</speed>。",
        "bodyHtml": "菲奥娜识别出敌方英雄身上的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">破绽</span>。用一次攻击或技能命中这个<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">破绽</span>会造成额外的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(3% + ([[si:scalead]]每100点额外攻击力4%))最大生命值的真实伤害</span>，并为菲奥娜提供在2秒里持续衰减的<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">?%移动速度</span>，并回复<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(35 ~ 100)生命值</span>。<br /><br />菲奥娜会在15秒后或是击中一个<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">破绽</span>后找出一个新破绽。",
        "iconFile": "Fiora_P.png",
